  "brief": {
    "zh": "在 54 回合内用脉冲让四台对手机器人停机，芽芽要留在场上。两场灯会的左侧入场道和机器人出发位置不同。第 8 回合末入场道换位，第 16 回合末护盾花灯滑入中庭。用 pick() 按下中庭的彩带开关，可打开通往东侧的近路。从容模式需要同一份程序通过两场。紧张模式在第一场对抗。",
    "en": "Tag out all 4 robots with pulses within 54 turns and keep Sprout running. The two parades have different entrance lanes and robot positions. The entrance changes after turn 8. A shield lantern slides into the courtyard after turn 16. Press the courtyard ribbon switch with pick() to open the eastern shortcut. In relaxed mode, clear both parades with the same program. Timed mode uses the first parade."
  },
